---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | MarqDesk" description="MarqDesk privacy policy: no accounts, no tracking of calculator inputs, and clear explanations of what little data is involved.">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-900 dark:text-brand-100">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
    <p><strong>Short version:</strong> MarqDesk does not require accounts, does not collect personal information, and does not send your calculator inputs anywhere.</p>
    <p><strong>Calculator inputs.</strong> All tools run entirely in your browser. The numbers you type are processed on your device and are never transmitted to us.</p>
    <p><strong>Local preferences.</strong> If you use the theme toggle, your choice (light or dark) is stored in your browser's local storage on your device. It is not sent to any server.</p>
    <p><strong>Analytics and advertising.</strong> MarqDesk does not currently use analytics or advertising.</p>
    <p><strong>Hosting.</strong> MarqDesk is hosted on GitHub Pages. As with any website, GitHub's servers automatically receive standard technical information (such as IP address and browser type) when pages are requested. See GitHub's own privacy policy for details.</p>
    <p><strong>Changes.</strong> If this policy changes in the future, the updated version will be published on this page.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
